# Project Title: Higher/Lower Followeing Game

## Description

This folder has a main script that is used so that the user can play a follower count guessing game where the user gets to guess weather or not one person/channel has more followers than the other. 


### Dependencies

Optional: ASCII_Art.py - this script has the logo for the Calculator. Not mandatory, but adds a little bit of flavour to the mix.

Mandatory: 

Follower_data.py --> Has all the info of people and channels. Feel free to add more to the dictionary

### Installations Needed

NA

